  "//": "Event -> sound map (see game/scripts/Audio/SoundEventMap.cs). Sound ids are remnants-assets export/audio/manifest.json ids. Retune here; [] = deliberately silent. Look-ups fall back by dropping the last dotted part. Volumes add to the manifest's default_volume_db.",

  "//mix": "dB per bus on top of the player's sliders. Measured with --audio-meter: the pipeline normalises music to -16 LUFS (peaks near -1 dBFS), ambience to -22 LUFS, one-shots to -1 dBFS peak; this sits music about 8 dB under gunfire and keeps UI blips (normalised to -3 dBFS) audible over the colony music.",
